## Task Analysis

The main goal of this visulationzation is to help people explore companies and to understand stock performance changes over times. Users should be able to look into trends and patterns in stock prices and compare the performance of the different companies across different time periods. This would help users understand if a company's stock increase or decrease over time. 

The main tasks include
Exploring stock perforamnce to discover trends and patterns
Identify significant increases decreaes in a company's stock
Compare stock performance of different companies
Locate companies high or low performance
Summarize the company performance
Discover potenital relationship between the major changes in the stock performance
